- [boat vs Cloudflare Sandbox: full VMs vs Workers containers](https://boat.dev/compare/boat-vs-cloudflare-sandbox): boat vs Cloudflare Sandbox SDK: full VMs that save their disk with no code and run Docker, against Workers containers that keep files through snapshots or R2.
